{
  "version": "2.2",
  "novel": {"title": "夏の日の冒険", "author": "山田太郎"},
  "chapters": [{"id": "ch1", "title": "第1章：洞窟への道", "sections": [{"id": "sec1", "title": "第1節：出発"}, {"id": "sec2", "title": "第2節：到着"}]}],
  "characters": [
    {"id": "char1", "name": "田中 健太", "shortName": "健", "gender": "male", "description": "好奇心旺盛な12歳の少年。", "bubbleColor": "#DBEAFE", "iconColor": "#3B82F6", "iconImage": null},
    {"id": "char2", "name": "佐藤 美咲", "shortName": "美", "gender": "female", "description": "健太の幼馴染。しっかり者だが怖がり。", "bubbleColor": "#FCE7F3", "iconColor": "#EC4899", "iconImage": null},
    {"id": "narrator", "name": "ナレーター", "shortName": "ナ", "gender": "neutral", "description": "物語の進行役", "bubbleColor": "#F3F4F6", "iconColor": "#6B7280", "iconImage": null}
  ],
  "content": [
    {"id": "c1", "type": "narration", "text": "真夏の太陽が照りつける中、少年は海辺の小道を歩いていた。潮風が頬を撫で、遠くでカモメの鳴き声が聞こえる。", "characterId": null, "order": 0},
    {"id": "c2", "type": "dialogue", "characterId": "char1", "text": "やっと着いた！ここが例の洞窟なんだね。", "order": 1},
    {"id": "c3", "type": "dialogue", "characterId": "char2", "text": "でも、ちょっと怖いかも。。。本当に入るの？", "order": 2},
    {"id": "c4", "type": "narration", "text": "二人は洞窟の入り口に立ち、暗闇の奥を見つめた。そこには、想像を超える冒険が待っていた。", "characterId": null, "order": 3},
    {"id": "c5", "type": "pageBreak", "order": 4},
    {"id": "c6", "type": "narration", "text": "洞窟の中は意外にも涼しく、天井から水滴がぽたぽたと落ちていた。懐中電灯の光が壁を照らすと、不思議な模様が浮かび上がった。", "characterId": null, "order": 5},
    {"id": "c7", "type": "dialogue", "characterId": "char1", "text": "すごい！見て、壁に何か描いてあるよ！古代の地図みたいだ！", "order": 6},
    {"id": "c8", "type": "dialogue", "characterId": "char2", "text": "本当だ...これ、宝の地図じゃない？健太、もしかしてこれが噂の...!", "order": 7},
    {"id": "c9", "type": "narration", "text": "二人の目が輝いた。夏休み最大の冒険が、今始まろうとしていた。", "characterId": null, "order": 8}
  ],
  "displaySettings": {"fontSize": 18, "lineHeight": 2.0, "iconSize": 56, "font": "'Shippori Mincho', serif", "orientation": "horizontal", "narratorStyle": "bubble"}
}
